no_target_yet.statement:
The metric $d$ is of negative type, and all nonempty principal submatrices
of $Z$ are positive definite. The deletion procedure stops after two solves
with
\begin{equation}
 p=\frac1{61601}(15961,22820,0,0,22820)^T.
\end{equation}
Nevertheless, for
\begin{equation}
 p'=\frac{999}{1000}p+\frac1{1000}e_3
 =\frac1{61601000}(15945039,22797180,0,61601,22797180)^T
\end{equation}
one has
\begin{equation}
 E(p)-E(p')=\frac{1707687919}{246404000000000}>0.
\end{equation}
